# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in keys for ONE provider.
# The dev proxy (vite.config.ts) checks providers in this order and uses the
# first one that has a key configured: OpenRouter -> OpenAI -> Gemini -> Groq.
# See README.md "Choosing a provider at scale" for which one to pick.

# OpenRouter (recommended — best pooled throughput)
OPENROUTER_API_KEY_1=sk-or-your_key_here
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY_2=sk-or-...   # optional additional keys to round-robin

# Or OpenAI
# OPENAI_API_KEY_1=sk-your_key_here

# Or Gemini
# GEMINI_API_KEY_1=your_key_here

# Or Groq (lowest free-tier throughput — fine for small classes only)
# GROQ_API_KEY_1=gsk_your_key_here
